{"id":"e_vier","lemma":"évier","pos":"noun","rank":4678,"glosses":["sink, basin"],"ipa":"/e.vje/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-%C3%A9vier.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-%C3%A9vier.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"éviers"},"examples":[{"text":"J'ai récuré l'évier.","en":"I scrubbed the sink.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1097850","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Je vous réparerai votre évier, si vous voulez.","en":"I'll fix your sink for you if you want.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to repair, fix, mend","l":"réparer"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null,{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"}]},{"text":"Je te réparerai ton évier, si tu veux.","en":"I'll fix your sink for you if you want.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to repair, fix, mend","l":"réparer"},{"g":"your"},null,{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"}]},{"text":"Je pensais que tu allais réparer l'évier.","en":"I thought you were going to fix the sink.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to think","l":"penser"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"to repair, fix, mend"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"J'ai vu l'éponge dans l'évier.","en":"I saw the sponge in the sink.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"sponge"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}